            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "Emma was living alone with her younger brother until one day he has disappeared in eerie circumstances. Help Emma find her brother and learn what has happened.<br><br><strong>Gameplay</strong><br>The Madness of Little Emma is a randomly generated action platformer with heavy Rogue-like elements. In her journey Emma will discover tons of varied items and encounter multitudes of unique enemies.<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 100 hours of challenging gameplay<br></li><li>Over 250 items<br></li><li>5 playable characters - each with completely different playstyle<br></li><li>Almost a hundred unique enemy types<br></li><li>25 bosses<br></li><li>Five episodes and multiple hidden areas<br></li><li>Persistent Steam leaderboard<br></li><li>A curious story<br></li><li>6 cutscenes (intro + 5 endings)<br></li><li>XB360 Controller support<br></li><li>Top-quality pixel art<br></li><li>Cinematic music<br></li><li>Lots of Achievements and unlockables<br></li><li>Tons of Secrets</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "Emma was living alone with her younger brother until one day he has disappeared in eerie circumstances. Help Emma find her brother and learn what has happened.<br><br><strong>Gameplay</strong><br>The Madness of Little Emma is a randomly generated action platformer with heavy Rogue-like elements. In her journey Emma will discover tons of varied items and encounter multitudes of unique enemies.<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 100 hours of challenging gameplay<br></li><li>Over 250 items<br></li><li>5 playable characters - each with completely different playstyle<br></li><li>Almost a hundred unique enemy types<br></li><li>25 bosses<br></li><li>Five episodes and multiple hidden areas<br></li><li>Persistent Steam leaderboard<br></li><li>A curious story<br></li><li>6 cutscenes (intro + 5 endings)<br></li><li>XB360 Controller support<br></li><li>Top-quality pixel art<br></li><li>Cinematic music<br></li><li>Lots of Achievements and unlockables<br></li><li>Tons of Secrets</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "The Madness of Little Emma is a difficult action platformer with roguelike elements. Featuring over 250 items with insane synergies, varied enemies, and numerous secrets and mysteries to discover.",
